imes.com/photo/135211769.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[v A federal judge in California issued a temporary halt on federal investigations into suspected noncitizen voter registration. This ruling follows concerns regarding the reliance on flawed data by federal agents during their investigations. Judge Araceli Martínez-Olguín stated that the investigations risked intimidating eligible voters ahead of the elections. The case was brought forward by several civic organizations advocating for voter rights.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-federal-judge-ordered-a-pause-in-trump-administration-investigations-of-suspected-noncitizen-voter-registration-across-nine-states-citing-unreliable-data-but-put-her-own-order-on-hold-to-allow-an-appeal/articleshow/135211769.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-federal-judge-ordered-a-pause-in-trump-administration-investigations-of-suspected-noncitizen-voter-registration-across-nine-states-citing-unreliable-data-but-put-her-own-order-on-hold-to-allow-an-appeal/articleshow/135211769.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:21:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135212438,imgsize-1846258.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Massachusetts gun owners face a registration deadline, while Idaho voters choose a state firearm]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135212463.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Gun legislation is making headlines as the U.S. elections approach, with Massachusetts taking a strict stance while Idaho opts for a more symbolic gesture. Massachusetts enforces a deadline for firearm registration as it nears the polls, raising concerns about the legal ramifications for compliant gun owners. In stark contrast, Idaho's ballot proposal to designate an official state firearm serves as a tribute to its hunting heritage without direct legal consequences.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/massachusetts-gun-owners-face-an-october-28-registration-deadline-six-days-before-voters-decide-whether-to-repeal-the-law-behind-it-while-idaho-voters-will-choose-an-official-state-gun-from-six-historic-firearms/articleshow/135212463.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/massachusetts-gun-owners-face-an-october-28-registration-deadline-six-days-before-voters-decide-whether-to-repeal-the-law-behind-it-while-idaho-voters-will-choose-an-official-state-gun-from-six-historic-firearms/articleshow/135212463.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:57:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135213099,imgsize-1260317.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-American Texas student says he's 'politically homeless' after facing backlash for voting for Democrat: 'My biggest concern is....']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135213008.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-american-texas-student-says-hes-politically-homeless-after-facing-backlash-for-voting-for-democrat-my-biggest-concern-is-/articleshow/135213008.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-american-texas-student-says-hes-politically-homeless-after-facing-backlash-for-voting-for-democrat-my-biggest-concern-is-/articleshow/135213008.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:54:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toi